exports[`generatePlan > matches the snapshot for the sample beginner (3x/week, dumbbells + bench, knee) 2`] = `"Full Body 3x/week for general fitness: 3 sessions per week of about 45 minutes. Weeks 1-5 build up gradually; week 6 is a deload with fewer sets so you recover. Work up to the top of each rep range on every set, then add weight and start again at the bottom of the range. Deload sessions in week 6 are shorter on purpose. As a beginner you stop each set with 3-4 reps in reserve and never train to failure. Exercises that load your knee are left out. This plan is general fitness guidance, not medical advice."`;
